WEBVTT

02:44.000 --> 02:44.930
This won't work.

03:03.840 --> 03:05.370
"Laughter in the Vast Sea?"

03:12.190 --> 03:15.390
"Laughter in the vast sea;
tides surging on both shores."

03:15.630 --> 03:17.430
"Drifting with the waves,
living only for today."

03:17.430 --> 03:19.280
"The people laugh, no longer lonely."

03:19.280 --> 03:21.870
"The passion remains in foolish laughter."

03:25.910 --> 03:26.640
Who's there?

03:27.520 --> 03:28.250
Who's there?

03:28.870 --> 03:29.630
Sancai.

03:30.910 --> 03:32.110
Swordsman Sancai.

03:43.800 --> 03:44.240
You...

03:55.360 --> 03:57.079
W-Who are you?

04:03.520 --> 04:04.450
What do you want?

04:06.520 --> 04:07.320
Let me ask you.

04:09.750 --> 04:12.150
Back when you were
homeless on the streets,

04:13.360 --> 04:15.290
were you saved by a mysterious man?

04:17.630 --> 04:18.760
How do you know that?

04:35.750 --> 04:37.680
Because I was that mysterious man.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.610
How can you prove it?

04:41.070 --> 04:42.200
When we parted ways,

04:43.630 --> 04:45.920
I left you a secret code for recognition.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.120
Secret code?

04:49.120 --> 04:50.780
"Spring sleep knows no dawn."

04:50.950 --> 04:52.310
"Mosquitoes bite me everywhere."

04:52.310 --> 04:54.040
"When I roll over in the night…"

04:54.310 --> 04:56.310
"Countless get crushed to death."

05:00.360 --> 05:01.490
You're truly the man

05:01.870 --> 05:03.000
who saved me back then.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.730
He's really Swordsman Sancai.

05:04.750 --> 05:05.510
In the original novel,

05:05.510 --> 05:07.630
there were three music enthusiasts
skilled in rhythm.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.480
I thought three was too many,
so I merged them into one.

05:09.480 --> 05:11.630
Then I made him an undercover agent
in the Power Gang,

05:11.630 --> 05:14.040
a loyal guy who provided information
to the protagonists.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.270
Unexpectedly, the system was destroyed,

05:15.270 --> 05:16.930
but this character remained.

05:18.120 --> 05:19.180
Alright, alright.

05:20.950 --> 05:23.560
I forgot. May I ask your name?

05:25.390 --> 05:27.120
I'm Xiao Qiushui.

05:27.480 --> 05:29.040
You're Xiao Qiushui?

05:30.070 --> 05:30.630
Hold on.

05:30.920 --> 05:33.750
Didn't you say you do good deeds
without leaving your name?

05:33.750 --> 05:35.810
Why are you telling me who you are now?

05:38.000 --> 05:39.270
Did I say that?

05:40.159 --> 05:41.159
I understand now.

05:41.390 --> 05:43.720
My sincerity must have moved the heavens.

05:43.750 --> 05:45.040
That's why you were sent to me,

05:45.040 --> 05:45.630
right?

05:46.310 --> 05:47.110
You know what?

05:47.310 --> 05:48.480
Since we parted last time,

05:48.480 --> 05:50.360
I've felt like I was waiting for someone

05:50.360 --> 05:52.040
to kickstart my life's mission.

05:52.040 --> 05:54.310
And somehow I felt that person was you.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.159
So,

05:55.159 --> 05:57.190
I've been playing music nonstop.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.360
Finally, you showed up.

06:00.000 --> 06:01.000
How wonderful!

06:02.040 --> 06:02.630
However,

06:03.000 --> 06:04.360
there's one more thing.

06:04.680 --> 06:05.510
I always feel

06:05.600 --> 06:07.920
there's another world beyond ours.

06:08.510 --> 06:10.310
Actually,
I really want someone to confide in,

06:10.310 --> 06:12.040
but no one here understands me.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.530
For example,

06:13.680 --> 06:14.480
in my mind,

06:14.680 --> 06:16.680
I keep hearing melodies like this.

06:29.950 --> 06:30.680
Stop singing.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.270
You sing quite well,

06:32.560 --> 06:34.159
and it sounds somewhat familiar.

06:34.159 --> 06:35.190
Come and sit.

06:35.360 --> 06:37.190
-You…
-Come and sit.

06:37.720 --> 06:39.000
So you've heard it too!

06:39.510 --> 06:40.270
I knew it.

06:40.480 --> 06:42.070
You didn't just save my life

06:42.240 --> 06:43.640
but truly understand me.

06:44.390 --> 06:46.250
Oh, right, there's one more line.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.800
It's been ringing in my head like thunder,

06:49.120 --> 06:50.180
so full of emotion.

06:50.430 --> 06:52.690
But I've never understood what it means.

06:56.720 --> 06:57.480
What line?

07:00.160 --> 07:00.960
Drink slowly.

07:05.430 --> 07:06.800
Screw the 9-to-6 grind!

07:07.000 --> 07:10.310
I don't want to do this job
for another day!

07:14.870 --> 07:15.330
What...

07:15.720 --> 07:16.720
What does it mean?

07:21.310 --> 07:22.190
This line is

07:23.040 --> 07:24.310
packed with emotion.

07:25.240 --> 07:28.800
Only someone with certain life experiences
can understand it.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.270
You can't comprehend it yet.

07:33.680 --> 07:34.870
I see.

07:35.560 --> 07:36.690
I really hope one day

07:36.830 --> 07:39.390
I can have
such unique life experiences too.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.480
Oh, one more thing.

07:44.750 --> 07:46.600
I've never dared to tell anyone about it.

07:46.600 --> 07:47.360
I always feel

07:49.310 --> 07:52.510
that this world is a huge book.

07:59.950 --> 08:01.210
That's what you think?

08:02.070 --> 08:04.310
Do you think this idea of mine is crazy?

08:04.600 --> 08:06.240
You know what? Whenever I fall asleep,

08:06.240 --> 08:08.770
all kinds of weird words
flash before my eyes.

08:10.390 --> 08:11.430
Oh, one time,

08:11.720 --> 08:13.050
I saw a passage that said

08:13.160 --> 08:14.510
you went to the Golden Summit
of the Emei Sect

08:14.510 --> 08:15.600
and became the unparalleled

08:15.600 --> 08:17.720
and revered Martial Arts Alliance Leader.

08:17.720 --> 08:20.120
And me? I was standing beside you,
serving you tea.

08:20.120 --> 08:21.950
No, I mean, handing you your armor.

08:21.950 --> 08:24.190
You shouted 8 words:

08:24.270 --> 08:27.390
"I'm invincible in Shenzhou,
yet lonely as snow."

08:30.680 --> 08:32.549
Isn't that the scene I once wrote?

08:35.000 --> 08:36.929
Why do you think I saw that passage?

08:36.960 --> 08:38.789
Could it really be like
that old physician said—

08:38.789 --> 08:39.840
that I'm sick?

08:41.750 --> 08:43.669
Listen, don't overthink it.

08:43.750 --> 08:46.200
Don't make assumptions,
and don't get nervous.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.600
Come, sit down.

08:47.790 --> 08:48.840
I'll tell you why.

08:51.270 --> 08:52.130
I'm so thirsty.

08:58.550 --> 09:00.750
Oh, my god.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.130
What am I saying?

09:02.960 --> 09:03.960
According to what you said,

09:03.960 --> 09:05.870
another world is affecting this one.

09:05.870 --> 09:06.910
You gave me the ability to foresee things,

09:06.910 --> 09:08.510
so I know some future events.

09:09.030 --> 09:10.270
But you entered this world

09:10.270 --> 09:11.670
and became Xiao Qiushui,

09:11.670 --> 09:12.960
changing parts of the storyline.

09:12.960 --> 09:15.440
So what I've foreseen
is no longer accurate.

09:17.270 --> 09:18.070
That's right.

09:20.120 --> 09:23.450
So now, you're not just
an undercover agent in the Power Gang

09:23.910 --> 09:25.510
but also my trusted partner.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.270
Because I created you,

09:30.240 --> 09:32.270
your mind

09:32.550 --> 09:34.750
holds information from another world.

09:35.510 --> 09:36.910
But in my memory,

09:38.670 --> 09:40.530
information from the other world

09:42.200 --> 09:43.600
is getting less and less.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.360
It's okay.

09:45.750 --> 09:46.720
You have me.

09:46.720 --> 09:48.520
I'll help you figure things out.

09:48.720 --> 09:51.480
You made me such a great

09:51.750 --> 09:52.790
and important man,

09:52.790 --> 09:54.440
but I left you in this world

09:54.440 --> 09:55.700
to bear all this alone.

09:56.270 --> 09:57.150
I really hate myself

09:57.150 --> 09:59.280
for not finding you sooner to help you.

10:00.790 --> 10:02.870
So what do we do next?

10:10.480 --> 10:12.410
I need to find the Power Gang first.

10:15.270 --> 10:16.150
What a coincidence!

10:16.150 --> 10:18.870
I'm an undercover agent in the Power Gang.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.440
I've been lying low for so long,

10:20.440 --> 10:22.240
never knowing what I was doing.

10:22.480 --> 10:25.000
I've been itching to make a big move.

10:25.630 --> 10:26.290
From now on,

10:26.360 --> 10:28.030
we'll see each other

10:28.030 --> 10:29.320
as brothers.

10:29.790 --> 10:30.850
Whatever you need,

10:30.910 --> 10:31.910
just say the word.

10:33.030 --> 10:33.600
Okay.

10:34.510 --> 10:35.320
Sancai.

10:36.360 --> 10:36.960
Come here.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.210
Is that okay?

10:46.150 --> 10:47.200
Great idea!

10:47.550 --> 10:49.240
What should I do?

10:49.440 --> 10:50.240
We're going

10:50.440 --> 10:53.000
to bring something to that old fox.

10:54.270 --> 10:55.390
That's easy.

10:55.630 --> 10:56.830
What are we bringing?

10:58.670 --> 10:59.270
A corpse.

11:00.120 --> 11:00.840
C-Cor…

11:02.360 --> 11:03.960
I didn't give you great lightness skill.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.960
Don't fly around recklessly again.

11:06.630 --> 11:07.230
Thank you.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.290
Sword King,

11:18.240 --> 11:19.960
this man was lurking outside the mansion,

11:19.960 --> 11:21.120
caught by the guards.

11:21.120 --> 11:22.510
He's at your mercy.

11:28.600 --> 11:31.080
Get Liu Suifeng here.

11:33.150 --> 11:35.870
Xiao Qiushui,
you've restored your meridians?

11:37.360 --> 11:38.320
Cut the crap.

11:42.030 --> 11:43.960
Since I've restored my meridians,

11:44.550 --> 11:47.750
I'll kill all of you someday.

11:51.390 --> 11:54.870
You actually came to my turf
to look for Liu Suifeng.

11:58.080 --> 11:58.960
Your turf?

11:59.840 --> 12:01.370
Don't tell me the Power Gang

12:01.600 --> 12:04.530
is so broke that you only
have one meeting point left.

12:07.150 --> 12:07.790
Hurry up.

12:08.360 --> 12:11.150
Hand over Liu Suifeng's man to me.

12:12.150 --> 12:14.150
You think Liu Suifeng's man is here?

12:14.240 --> 12:15.240
Stop pretending.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.440
If you won't hand him over,

12:18.150 --> 12:21.270
I don't mind tearing this place down.

12:25.550 --> 12:26.870
This is my residence.

12:28.000 --> 12:28.870
You just said

12:30.000 --> 12:31.460
Liu Suifeng's man is here.

12:31.480 --> 12:32.320
What does he look like?

12:32.320 --> 12:34.080
What does he look like? Ordinary-looking.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.960
He wears the same clothes as they do.

12:35.960 --> 12:36.760
Xiao Qiushui,

12:36.910 --> 12:39.480
I haven't settled
the Guangling score with you yet.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.880
Indeed, we haven't settled our scores yet.

12:42.440 --> 12:43.960
I followed Liu Suifeng

12:44.390 --> 12:46.000
and saw him secretly give a map

12:46.000 --> 12:47.400
to someone in this house.

12:47.720 --> 12:49.780
Or I wouldn't have followed him here.

12:50.080 --> 12:50.790
What map?

12:51.270 --> 12:52.870
Will you hand him over or not?

12:54.030 --> 12:55.230
You can draw it for me.

12:55.790 --> 12:58.080
Perhaps we can talk.

13:00.390 --> 13:00.840
Move.

13:25.870 --> 13:26.870
I was too far away.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.400
Something like this.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.120
What did you draw?

13:37.270 --> 13:39.130
I've never seen anything like it.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.030
I get it.

13:44.390 --> 13:45.650
Liu Suifeng can freely

13:45.670 --> 13:47.550
enter and leave your residence

13:47.790 --> 13:49.120
without you noticing.

13:50.150 --> 13:50.810
Never mind.

13:51.550 --> 13:53.200
There's no point asking you for him.

13:53.200 --> 13:53.910
I'm leaving.

13:53.910 --> 13:54.720
Xiao Qiushui.

13:56.550 --> 13:58.880
Don't think I don't know
what you're up to.

13:59.750 --> 14:01.080
You hate the Power Gang,

14:01.080 --> 14:02.960
so you're deliberately sowing discord.

14:02.960 --> 14:05.630
You keep saying
you only want to kill Liu Suifeng.

14:05.630 --> 14:07.230
Don't you want to kill me too?

14:13.000 --> 14:14.150
I do want to kill you.

14:15.320 --> 14:16.920
But compared to Liu Suifeng,

14:17.080 --> 14:19.010
who slaughtered my entire family,

14:20.320 --> 14:22.580
the grudge I have against you is nothing.

14:22.750 --> 14:24.350
So you want Liu Suifeng dead?

14:25.440 --> 14:26.840
That's quite ambitious.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.200
For me,

14:30.270 --> 14:31.600
it's indeed difficult.

14:32.150 --> 14:33.440
But with your help,

14:34.200 --> 14:35.730
it might not be impossible.

14:36.200 --> 14:39.320
Liu Suifeng has planted
his men around you.

14:39.630 --> 14:40.750
If I were you,

14:42.270 --> 14:43.440
I couldn't stand it.

14:47.840 --> 14:51.320
They say the Sword King is
the head of the Eight Kings.

14:51.960 --> 14:52.790
And yet

14:53.270 --> 14:55.330
you let some upstart overshadow you.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.320
If I were you,

14:58.080 --> 14:59.540
I'd seek to take his place.

15:01.790 --> 15:02.850
How presumptuous!

15:03.550 --> 15:05.480
You're nothing but a stray dog now,

15:05.600 --> 15:07.240
powerless and mediocre in martial arts.

15:07.240 --> 15:09.040
You can't even defeat my guards.

15:09.270 --> 15:11.510
What makes you think you can work with me?

15:11.510 --> 15:13.370
My martial skills may be average,

15:14.480 --> 15:15.670
but I'm quite smart.

15:16.600 --> 15:18.400
I have no power or influence now,

15:20.360 --> 15:24.150
but don't you want the Hero Command Token?

15:26.320 --> 15:29.510
Why don't you consider working with me?

15:30.790 --> 15:31.650
What do you say?

15:33.120 --> 15:35.180
So you do have the Hero Command Token.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.550
That cunning Liu Suifeng

15:41.550 --> 15:43.080
was watching you all along.

15:43.600 --> 15:46.460
If you really had it,
how could he not have found out?

15:49.480 --> 15:50.880
If you want to make a deal,

15:51.240 --> 15:52.360
show it to me first.

15:52.870 --> 15:54.670
You think I'm still that stupid?

15:55.150 --> 15:56.240
If I take it out now,

15:56.790 --> 15:58.720
I'd be handing it over for nothing.

15:59.150 --> 16:00.010
How about this?

16:01.360 --> 16:01.910
I can

16:03.600 --> 16:05.120
tell you a secret first.

16:18.910 --> 16:20.370
On the Hero Command Token,

16:20.790 --> 16:23.120
there are the fingerprints of the leaders

16:23.670 --> 16:25.870
of the Shaolin, Wudang, and Emei Sects.

16:27.750 --> 16:28.910
Very few

16:29.360 --> 16:31.440
in the martial world know this.

16:31.910 --> 16:33.570
Does he really have the token?

16:34.200 --> 16:36.080
Just help me kill Liu Suifeng.

16:37.240 --> 16:38.360
Once it's done,

16:39.600 --> 16:41.030
I'll give it to you.

16:44.790 --> 16:46.250
You'd really give it to me?

16:47.720 --> 16:51.000
I'm the one who once tried to kill you

16:51.000 --> 16:52.600
and severed your meridians.

16:54.390 --> 16:55.670
You crippled me,

16:56.630 --> 16:58.230
and I exposed your identity.

17:00.390 --> 17:01.920
What happened in Guangling

17:02.910 --> 17:04.480
made me realize

17:05.270 --> 17:07.069
that I couldn't make the best use

17:08.240 --> 17:10.030
of the Hero Command Token,

17:11.720 --> 17:13.520
and it only brought me disaster.

17:14.640 --> 17:15.880
My parents

17:16.960 --> 17:18.750
died because of it too.

17:19.960 --> 17:21.680
Help me kill Liu Suifeng.

17:22.680 --> 17:23.680
Once it's done,

17:24.960 --> 17:27.020
the Hero Command Token will be yours.

17:34.640 --> 17:35.200
Master,

17:35.830 --> 17:36.960
we found Kang Chuyu.

17:37.310 --> 17:38.040
Bring him in.

17:38.720 --> 17:40.450
I'm afraid you have to come out.

17:52.070 --> 17:52.800
Who did this?

17:53.880 --> 17:56.350
The body's badly decayed.
It's hard to tell the wounds.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.590
We found this on him.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.030
A Death Beetle?

18:02.480 --> 18:04.480
Let the Death Beetle found on Mr. Qiu

18:04.680 --> 18:05.960
give you one more push.

18:06.200 --> 18:08.200
The Eight Kings and above
all use golden Death Beetles.

18:08.200 --> 18:09.200
Ordinary Death Beetles like this

18:09.200 --> 18:11.550
are only used to control spies
planted in different sects.

18:11.550 --> 18:13.210
How did it end up on Kang Chuyu?

18:13.880 --> 18:14.740
Besides Chief,

18:15.000 --> 18:17.460
only Liu Suifeng
can control Death Beetles.

18:17.750 --> 18:19.350
And he's always targeted you,

18:19.350 --> 18:20.680
messing with our plans.

18:20.750 --> 18:23.070
He must have used the Death Beetle
without permission

18:23.070 --> 18:24.330
to control Kang Chuyu,

18:24.480 --> 18:25.830
stealing our secrets.

18:27.030 --> 18:29.440
If he discovers that we...

18:33.750 --> 18:36.950
Looks like we have to kill Liu Suifeng
as soon as possible.

18:38.830 --> 18:39.640
But the Misery Pill

18:39.640 --> 18:41.750
in your body is still active.

18:42.200 --> 18:43.400
It's such a headache.

18:43.550 --> 18:44.750
It must be dealt with.

18:46.000 --> 18:46.680
Sword King,

18:47.920 --> 18:49.640
you need to think this through

18:49.920 --> 18:50.920
and make up your mind quickly.

18:50.920 --> 18:51.980
If you're too late,

18:52.240 --> 18:53.480
the Hero Command Token

18:53.480 --> 18:56.200
will be taken by Suifeng.

19:00.680 --> 19:02.080
I can cooperate with you,

19:02.510 --> 19:03.590
but before that,

19:04.070 --> 19:05.920
you must prove yourself worthy.

19:06.200 --> 19:07.070
If you can't,

19:08.640 --> 19:10.830
you're of no use to me.

19:11.200 --> 19:12.400
How should I prove it?

19:12.960 --> 19:15.510
Go to the Ghost King's stronghold
in Yimen Town

19:15.510 --> 19:16.840
to get something for me.

19:49.960 --> 19:50.510
Fang,

19:52.200 --> 19:54.750
there's been a lot on your mind lately.

19:56.110 --> 19:57.000
Are you…

19:58.880 --> 20:00.280
thinking about Qiushui?

20:07.110 --> 20:08.440
Father, I...

20:11.790 --> 20:13.310
I can see

20:15.000 --> 20:16.530
how you feel about that boy.

20:18.750 --> 20:20.550
I don't want to stop you.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.920
But what matters most now

20:23.920 --> 20:26.180
is the future of our branch of the family.

20:27.310 --> 20:30.440
The third branch has been eyeing
the master's position.

20:30.510 --> 20:31.510
And I am

20:33.000 --> 20:36.200
held back by old injuries.
There's not much I can do.

20:37.350 --> 20:37.920
Father,

20:38.270 --> 20:39.530
please don't say that.

20:40.270 --> 20:41.750
Once I find the "Voidheart Codex,"

20:41.750 --> 20:43.080
you'll surely recover.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.920
Actually,

20:48.640 --> 20:49.920
I don't just want

20:50.110 --> 20:52.370
the "Voidheart Codex" to heal my wounds.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.960
I want it so I can protect myself,

20:55.440 --> 20:58.640
our branch of the family,

21:00.720 --> 21:01.880
and you, Fang.

21:07.920 --> 21:08.380
Father!

21:11.240 --> 21:12.110
I understand.

21:13.200 --> 21:15.600
Let's go back.
It's time for your medicine.

21:20.350 --> 21:20.960
All right.

21:36.030 --> 21:36.510
Father!

22:07.880 --> 22:08.940
What are you doing?

22:16.920 --> 22:19.180
My father's been nothing but kind to you.

22:19.550 --> 22:21.480
Why are you betraying him?

22:21.590 --> 22:22.110
I...

22:28.030 --> 22:29.270
Are you forced to do this?

22:29.270 --> 22:30.440
I-I can't tell you.

22:30.960 --> 22:33.030
I failed Master,

22:33.310 --> 22:35.680
but I couldn't control myself.

22:35.680 --> 22:36.790
I'm in so much pain.

22:39.200 --> 22:41.000
I don't want to live like this.

23:01.750 --> 23:02.750
Death Beetle?

23:03.270 --> 23:03.880
Father.

23:05.000 --> 23:06.330
You recognize this bug?

23:06.590 --> 23:09.160
The Power Gang's infamous Misery Pills

23:09.640 --> 23:11.300
are made from this kind of bug.

23:12.000 --> 23:14.130
No wonder Mr. Li was acting strangely.

23:15.640 --> 23:17.700
But the Tang Sect is tightly guarded.

23:18.000 --> 23:20.460
How did the Power Gang
get this thing in here?

23:26.070 --> 23:27.670
It must be Tang Song's doing.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.480
Thanks to your clever plan,

23:34.480 --> 23:35.680
the Sword King now

23:35.680 --> 23:37.410
suspects everyone around him.

23:37.510 --> 23:38.510
He's on high alert.

23:38.510 --> 23:40.480
He only sent you to the Ghost King.

23:42.680 --> 23:44.740
But he doesn't fully trust me either.

23:46.440 --> 23:49.170
I feel he doesn't really want
to kill Liu Suifeng.

23:49.440 --> 23:51.640
He's just temporarily aligned with me.

23:52.400 --> 23:53.070
So,

23:53.830 --> 23:56.200
we might as well
turn his plan against him.

23:59.440 --> 24:00.680
You're so clever.

24:02.310 --> 24:05.270
But if you had made me

24:05.400 --> 24:06.310
a bit smarter,

24:06.790 --> 24:08.310
I'd be even more help now.

24:09.550 --> 24:10.200
Sancai,

24:11.350 --> 24:12.720
you're already a master of music

24:12.720 --> 24:15.030
and know so much
about the past and future.

24:15.030 --> 24:17.690
You're already
an excellent undercover agent.

24:18.110 --> 24:18.970
Think about it.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.640
If a character

24:20.830 --> 24:22.070
only had strengths,

24:22.310 --> 24:23.640
that would be so boring.

24:23.640 --> 24:26.170
So you're actually
quite adorable as you are.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.200
Really?

24:28.510 --> 24:29.310
You're right.

24:30.070 --> 24:30.680
Qiushui,

24:31.110 --> 24:33.640
thank you for making me
such a good character.

24:37.720 --> 24:38.320
By the way,

24:39.240 --> 24:41.590
the Sword King wants me
to get the Death Beetle King for him.

24:41.590 --> 24:42.790
Do you know what it is?

24:44.440 --> 24:46.480
It's vital to the Eight Kings.

24:46.830 --> 24:48.200
If the Sword King gets it,

24:48.200 --> 24:50.200
he won't have to fear Liu Suifeng anymore

24:50.200 --> 24:51.530
and can kill him at will.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.640
That's very crucial.

24:55.720 --> 24:58.640
But the Ghost King has a twisted taste.

24:59.000 --> 24:59.640
He likes

24:59.750 --> 25:02.410
to keep living people in coffins
as beetle feed.

25:02.590 --> 25:03.310
His base

25:03.310 --> 25:04.770
is known as the Coffin Den.

25:05.550 --> 25:07.790
If we go to the coffin shops
in Yimen Town,

25:07.790 --> 25:09.450
we'll surely find his traces.

25:11.680 --> 25:14.880
Rumor has it that the Ghost King is
paranoid and vigilant.

25:15.510 --> 25:18.000
Too many people
would arouse his suspicion.

25:31.720 --> 25:33.790
This thing works really well.

25:34.440 --> 25:35.510
It can make

25:35.920 --> 25:37.720
even the toughest guy do as told.

25:38.030 --> 25:39.430
This is the last one left.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.170
Don't worry.

25:40.480 --> 25:42.550
Ghost King has plenty of them.

25:45.000 --> 25:45.600
By the way,

25:45.960 --> 25:47.790
did you finish what I told you to do?

25:47.790 --> 25:48.990
Everything's ready.

26:00.310 --> 26:00.840
Let's go.

26:22.680 --> 26:23.830
Stop crying.

27:10.030 --> 27:11.360
Don't seal the coffins.

27:11.590 --> 27:12.880
Ghost King wants them alive.

27:12.880 --> 27:13.350
Yes.

27:14.310 --> 27:14.840
Let's go.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.730
What are you doing here?

27:30.000 --> 27:31.530
I'm here to find Ghost King.

27:31.750 --> 27:32.510
Mr. Tang.

27:33.550 --> 27:34.720
Miss Tang.

27:37.000 --> 27:37.600
Miss Song.

27:38.270 --> 27:40.110
Why does the Ghost King
suddenly need so much feed?

27:40.110 --> 27:41.920
Many of the Death Beetle King's eggs

27:41.920 --> 27:43.160
have lost their vitality lately.

27:43.160 --> 27:45.820
It urgently needs
human blood for nourishment.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.310
But that's only a temporary fix.

27:47.310 --> 27:48.350
To recover fully,

27:48.960 --> 27:50.830
it has to be taken
to the place Master mentioned

27:50.830 --> 27:52.230
for proper nourishment.

27:54.000 --> 27:54.600
By the way,

27:55.030 --> 27:57.830
the Power Gang
killed some traitors a few days ago.

27:58.240 --> 27:59.070
I heard

27:59.310 --> 28:02.880
Deputy Chief Liu and the Blade King
joined forces to kill the Fire King.

28:02.880 --> 28:04.880
Even your mysterious Chief Li

28:04.880 --> 28:06.480
and his wife showed up.

28:07.000 --> 28:07.730
Is that true?

28:08.510 --> 28:09.840
You're well-informed.

28:10.270 --> 28:11.160
If you ask me,

28:11.750 --> 28:13.790
with Deputy Chief Liu's unparalleled
martial arts skills,

28:13.790 --> 28:15.120
he could have dealt with

28:15.510 --> 28:16.770
the Fire King himself.

28:17.750 --> 28:19.590
Why make such a fuss?

28:20.590 --> 28:23.110
Don't tell me the Power Gang

28:23.790 --> 28:26.000
prefers extravagant methods.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.330
What do you know?

28:28.070 --> 28:29.930
Killing a king isn't that simple.

28:30.200 --> 28:32.590
Each of the Eight Kings
has their own agenda.

28:32.590 --> 28:34.250
Without checks and balances,

28:34.270 --> 28:36.070
the gang would've fallen into chaos.

28:36.070 --> 28:36.800
I'm curious.

28:37.400 --> 28:39.160
How does Chief Li keep the Eight Kings

28:39.160 --> 28:41.590
and Deputy Chief Liu
at peace with each other?

28:41.590 --> 28:44.160
Rumor has it
that the Eight Kings and above

28:44.550 --> 28:47.440
have all been implanted
with a Misery Pill.

28:48.400 --> 28:49.330
Could it be true?

28:49.830 --> 28:51.830
The best leverage against someone

28:51.830 --> 28:53.200
is their own life.

28:54.030 --> 28:57.110
So if they try to harm others,

28:58.110 --> 28:59.440
they'll die themselves?

28:59.440 --> 29:01.750
How dare you pry
into the Power Gang's secrets?

29:01.750 --> 29:02.920
Do you have a death wish?

29:02.920 --> 29:04.550
Please don't be angry, Miss Song.

29:04.550 --> 29:07.110
My sister didn't mean
to probe your secrets.

29:07.640 --> 29:08.830
We all serve Master

29:09.030 --> 29:10.360
with absolute loyalty.

29:12.750 --> 29:15.110
There truly are no secrets in this world.

29:15.960 --> 29:17.960
The Death Beetle King
that controls the Misery Pills

29:17.960 --> 29:19.830
was raised with the blood

29:19.830 --> 29:21.030
of Chief and Shirong.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.550
It only obeys those two.

29:22.880 --> 29:24.240
Even if others know this secret,

29:24.240 --> 29:25.040
it's useless.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.680
So don't waste your time scheming.

29:27.680 --> 29:30.280
So that's the purpose
of the Death Beetle King.

29:31.070 --> 29:32.590
Miss Song, you misunderstood.

29:32.590 --> 29:35.310
We were just concerned
about Deputy Chief Liu's safety.

29:35.310 --> 29:37.720
Since he's safe and sound,

29:38.000 --> 29:39.590
we can rest easy.

29:40.550 --> 29:42.550
However, if anything happens

29:42.550 --> 29:43.950
to the Death Beetle King,

29:44.270 --> 29:46.070
all the Death Beetles raised from its eggs

29:46.070 --> 29:47.440
will become ineffective.

29:47.440 --> 29:48.100
Therefore,

29:48.310 --> 29:50.550
if you want to keep controlling
those people in the Tang Sect,

29:50.550 --> 29:52.750
you must ensure
the Death Beetle King goes there on time

29:52.750 --> 29:54.880
to be nourished by nature's energy.

29:54.960 --> 29:55.690
Understood.

29:55.960 --> 29:57.640
I'll see to it.

29:57.880 --> 29:59.410
Master has already set out.

29:59.550 --> 30:00.480
We should go too.

30:00.680 --> 30:01.070
Yes.

30:01.110 --> 30:01.550
Yes.

30:06.270 --> 30:08.000
The Ghost King is unfathomable.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.330
Don't come any further.

31:26.590 --> 31:28.850
Deputy Chief, sorry to keep you waiting.

31:37.480 --> 31:40.590
That reckless new leader
of the Xiaoyao Sect

31:42.070 --> 31:46.480
actually dared to provoke the Power Gang.

31:47.200 --> 31:48.070
Deputy Chief,

31:48.790 --> 31:49.640
can you guess

31:50.720 --> 31:52.680
where he is now?

31:59.030 --> 32:01.290
Ghost King, you're in the mood for games.

32:01.590 --> 32:02.720
But what matters now

32:04.000 --> 32:06.130
is bringing the Death Beetle King out.

32:06.550 --> 32:07.880
It's weak at the moment.

32:08.880 --> 32:10.480
You need to be extra careful.

32:12.590 --> 32:14.190
I'm keeping a close eye on it.

32:14.480 --> 32:16.680
Deputy Chief, there's no need to worry.

32:25.750 --> 32:27.010
I smell living people.

32:27.350 --> 32:29.110
Deputy Chief, take a rest.

32:29.270 --> 32:31.750
I'll take the Death Beetle King
for a feast.

32:49.640 --> 32:50.300
Ghost King,

32:51.070 --> 32:52.530
here's fresh human blood.

32:52.720 --> 32:55.160
It will surely benefit
the Death Beetle King.

32:55.160 --> 32:55.750
Please.

33:11.920 --> 33:12.680
Good.

33:13.400 --> 33:14.400
He's alive.

33:14.960 --> 33:15.920
It's worth a try.

33:30.830 --> 33:32.490
That's the Death Beetle King.

33:32.550 --> 33:33.550
If I kill it,

33:34.200 --> 33:36.110
the Tang Sect disciples will be freed

33:36.110 --> 33:37.440
from the Death Beetles.

33:48.030 --> 33:48.550
No.

33:49.160 --> 33:50.960
There are other intruders here.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.270
Xiao Qiushui?

34:06.750 --> 34:07.950
Tang Song, Tang Qing,

34:08.150 --> 34:09.610
escort the Ghost King out.

34:11.070 --> 34:12.630
Split up and be careful.

34:46.360 --> 34:46.920
Oh, no.

34:47.480 --> 34:49.340
It's Energy-Dissolving Powder.

35:12.510 --> 35:13.840
His internal energy...

35:14.150 --> 35:15.350
How is this possible?

35:16.670 --> 35:17.480
Liu Suifeng.

35:19.880 --> 35:20.590
Today…

35:21.190 --> 35:21.840
Qiushui!

35:22.630 --> 35:24.030
There's an ambush below!

35:24.110 --> 35:24.770
Be careful!

35:27.590 --> 35:28.190
Tang Fang.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.000
Tang Fang! Tang Fang!

35:32.670 --> 35:33.870
Qiushui, be careful!

35:44.670 --> 35:46.230
Tang Fang, are you alright?

35:49.110 --> 35:51.440
I inhaled the Energy-Dissolving Powder.

35:54.110 --> 35:55.370
I'll get you out first.

36:01.230 --> 36:01.760
Let's go.

36:05.000 --> 36:05.840
Big Brother!

36:07.000 --> 36:07.760
Big Brother!

36:07.840 --> 36:09.190
Miss Tang, are you hurt?

36:09.920 --> 36:10.850
We're both fine.

36:11.510 --> 36:13.310
No time to talk. Save the others.

36:13.670 --> 36:14.280
Okay.

36:20.150 --> 36:21.750
Guys, check them carefully.

36:26.320 --> 36:26.960
Big Brother,

36:26.960 --> 36:28.220
he's still breathing.

36:29.440 --> 36:29.880
Yes.

36:30.190 --> 36:31.280
They've just been knocked out by poison.

36:31.280 --> 36:32.940
Their lives aren't in danger.

36:33.070 --> 36:33.630
Okay.

36:34.480 --> 36:35.710
Get them all out.

36:36.550 --> 36:37.880
Search the entire cave.

36:38.030 --> 36:40.070
Then we'll meet at Taoran Pavilion.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.630
The Ghost Cave has been exposed.

36:44.630 --> 36:47.090
But I can't lose control
of the Misery Pills.

36:47.400 --> 36:50.150
The Ghost King has left the Ghost Cave
with the Death Beetle King.

36:50.150 --> 36:50.760
Master.

36:51.030 --> 36:51.880
I don't think Xiao Qiushui

36:51.880 --> 36:53.190
will cause us any trouble now.

36:53.190 --> 36:54.450
How has Xiao Qiushui's

36:54.550 --> 36:57.800
internal energy grown so much stronger
in such a short time?

36:57.800 --> 36:59.660
Are you hiding something from me?

37:00.070 --> 37:00.590
I...

37:01.510 --> 37:01.960
I...

37:03.280 --> 37:04.230
I did keep something from you.

37:04.230 --> 37:06.560
Xiao Qiushui has taken the Infinite Pill.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.610
Do you know the price of betraying me?

37:19.800 --> 37:20.840
Master, let me explain.

37:20.840 --> 37:22.300
Even if it costs me my life,

37:22.320 --> 37:23.920
I'd never betray you.

37:24.800 --> 37:25.400
Is that so?

37:26.230 --> 37:27.030
What kind of spell

37:27.030 --> 37:28.630
has Xiao Qiushui cast on you?

37:30.030 --> 37:31.800
I didn't let him fool me.

37:33.150 --> 37:34.710
It's just that he saved me

37:34.710 --> 37:35.710
from Shao Liulei,

37:35.800 --> 37:37.530
and I wanted to repay that debt.

37:37.590 --> 37:39.000
I swear, apart from you, Master,

37:39.000 --> 37:41.070
I want no ties with anyone else.

37:41.480 --> 37:42.410
So you're saying

37:43.190 --> 37:44.850
anyone who has done you a favor

37:44.880 --> 37:46.080
can buy your loyalty?

37:46.760 --> 37:47.890
I won't keep someone

37:48.400 --> 37:49.480
as fickle as you

37:49.480 --> 37:50.590
by my side.

37:50.710 --> 37:51.840
Master, I was wrong.

37:52.630 --> 37:53.760
Even the greatest favor

37:53.760 --> 37:55.510
cannot shake my loyalty to you.

37:56.590 --> 37:58.840
I only helped him out of expedience.

37:59.920 --> 38:01.190
I was just curious

38:01.320 --> 38:03.320
to see what someone like him

38:04.510 --> 38:05.360
could do

38:05.360 --> 38:06.760
if he survived.

38:07.630 --> 38:09.230
But if he ever threatens you,

38:09.590 --> 38:10.720
I will not spare him.

38:11.550 --> 38:12.550
Someone like him?

38:13.960 --> 38:15.490
What kind of person is that?

38:21.590 --> 38:22.190
Answer me!

38:25.880 --> 38:27.070
I can't explain.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.360
I just feel

38:30.630 --> 38:33.110
that he's different from anyone

38:33.230 --> 38:34.560
I've ever known before.

38:35.280 --> 38:36.360
Every time I see him,

38:36.360 --> 38:37.220
he makes me feel

38:37.400 --> 38:39.600
that one doesn't have to live on the edge

38:40.070 --> 38:42.000
and could choose a different life.

38:47.670 --> 38:49.590
Maybe it's just
because he always does strange things

38:49.590 --> 38:50.920
and says strange words,

38:51.030 --> 38:52.630
and it feels new, that's all.

38:55.230 --> 38:56.430
Whatever the reason,

38:57.030 --> 38:58.760
hiding it from you was my fault.

39:00.030 --> 39:01.230
I accept punishment.

39:10.510 --> 39:12.370
Go kneel on the Repentance Cliff.

39:13.480 --> 39:15.000
No water for 7 days.

39:16.000 --> 39:17.200
If heaven sends rain,

39:18.480 --> 39:19.550
you may live.

39:23.400 --> 39:23.880
Yes.

39:27.550 --> 39:30.680
At this season, it's scorching
on the Repentance Cliff.

39:31.400 --> 39:34.200
Seven days kneeling there…
she may not survive it.

39:35.070 --> 39:36.880
Master has always been ruthless.

39:36.880 --> 39:37.760
You know that.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.550
I just thought

39:39.800 --> 39:41.860
he'd make an exception for Miss Song.

40:15.880 --> 40:16.480
No.

40:17.320 --> 40:18.120
You're wrong.

40:19.960 --> 40:22.090
Master could have killed me directly,

40:23.070 --> 40:24.150
but he didn't.

40:26.880 --> 40:30.280
He treats me differently after all.

40:44.800 --> 40:46.070
Cheers, Big Brother!

40:46.670 --> 40:47.130
Come on.

40:47.590 --> 40:49.840
Cheers.

40:54.110 --> 40:54.960
I think

40:55.150 --> 40:56.760
you should all toast to me next.

40:56.760 --> 40:58.360
If I hadn't noticed

40:58.760 --> 41:00.840
the clues Big Brother left along the way,

41:00.840 --> 41:02.440
it could've been dangerous.

41:04.400 --> 41:05.710
Then here's to you.

41:07.230 --> 41:07.960
Big Brother,

41:08.510 --> 41:10.760
as soon as we heard
that the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood

41:10.760 --> 41:12.440
was fighting with the Power Gang nearby,

41:12.440 --> 41:14.040
we rushed over immediately.

41:14.150 --> 41:16.070
We met these two brothers on the way

41:16.070 --> 41:17.670
and went together with them.

41:17.800 --> 41:19.000
But too bad—

41:19.360 --> 41:21.280
we found nothing in the Ghost Cave.

41:21.280 --> 41:22.760
They took everything away.

41:22.760 --> 41:25.150
Liu Suifeng has always been cautious,

41:25.230 --> 41:27.290
so he must have moved everything out.

41:28.590 --> 41:29.670
But it was worth it.

41:30.030 --> 41:32.190
As soon as I arrived today,
I saw Miss Tang

41:32.190 --> 41:34.190
standing very close to Big Brother.

41:35.360 --> 41:36.360
Right.

41:36.670 --> 41:38.070
I saw that too.

41:40.030 --> 41:43.510
The way Big Brother and Miss Tang
worked side by side,

41:43.800 --> 41:45.840
they really looked like a good match.

41:45.840 --> 41:47.030
Right!

41:47.030 --> 41:48.510
Shut up. What are you talking about?

41:48.510 --> 41:49.640
Stop this nonsense.

41:50.190 --> 41:51.150
Come on, drink.

41:52.070 --> 41:52.670
Drink up.

41:52.670 --> 41:53.800
Come on, cheers!

41:53.800 --> 41:55.230
Cheers, Big Brother!

41:55.440 --> 41:56.550
Come on, cheers!

41:58.070 --> 41:59.070
Everyone's here.

42:03.400 --> 42:04.800
Finally, we followed Zuoqiu's markers

42:04.800 --> 42:06.000
and found this place.

42:06.150 --> 42:08.010
Perfect timing. Sit down and eat.

42:08.360 --> 42:09.480
Please sit, Miss Qu.

42:09.480 --> 42:10.610
Two more wine bowls.

42:13.190 --> 42:13.880
Zuoqiu,

42:14.360 --> 42:17.110
aren't you going to introduce us
to your new friends?

42:17.110 --> 42:18.710
These two are the Qu sisters.

42:19.230 --> 42:20.110
I'm Tie Xingyue.

42:20.110 --> 42:20.910
I'm Qiu Nangu.

42:22.070 --> 42:22.630
Good.

42:23.440 --> 42:25.100
It's a reunion of old friends.

42:25.320 --> 42:27.510
Let's have a few more drinks.

42:27.840 --> 42:28.840
Alright, come on!

42:29.710 --> 42:32.370
The Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
is invincible!

42:42.590 --> 42:43.320
Look at this.

42:44.800 --> 42:46.110
I have to show it to you.

42:47.190 --> 42:47.800
This is…

42:49.110 --> 42:50.440
The Hero Command Token.

42:54.150 --> 42:55.210
How did you find it?

42:55.550 --> 42:58.360
That day, Old Madam Wu gave me a dagger.

43:00.000 --> 43:02.260
She said Mr. Zhang wanted
to give it to me.

43:02.400 --> 43:03.360
I accidentally discovered

43:03.360 --> 43:05.160
this crystal inside the dagger.

43:06.510 --> 43:08.000
This crystal is the Hero Command Token.
